+repository (see `CustomerFilter`), so the grid still pages and counts in the
+backend. The filter lives in the address bar as the query parameters `name` and
+`status`, e.g. `/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED`, so a filtered view can be
+bookmarked or shared.
